 =?UTF-8?q?port=20from=20the=20smart=20meter=20portal?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- logs in like the Mój Licznik app (api-mojlicznik.energa-operator.pl),
  every hour: meter totals A+/A-, today's and yesterday's hourly values;
  once: the last 62 days
- daily import/export go into the history (months/years corrected), today's
  values are used while there is no local meter; new column 'Zużycie domu'
  = production + import - export
- page /fusion/energa (menu: Licznik Energa); the password is never sent back

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EySGZ7zzCqzbQeGccwYzek
